Until a release DOI is minted, cite the exact GPUPDAL release or commit and
repository URL:

  Mazza, Zy (2026). GPUPDAL: GPU Point Data Abstraction Library.
  https://github.com/zymazza/GPUPDAL, commit <full commit SHA>.

GPUPDAL is derived from and retains the upstream PDAL implementation. When your
work relies on PDAL itself, also use PDAL's official citation:

  PDAL contributors (2026). PDAL: The Point Data Abstraction Library.
  https://pdal.org/. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10884408
